                                                "sense_id": "e559bd0b-ca07-3323-84af-6dd344cbaabd",
                                                "text": "The poor fellow took so much junk into his system he could only weather the greater proportion of his day in that chair with the lamp burning at noon, but in the morning he was magnificent."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "03a78a98-bca3-4569-b9ca-af5f63098da9",
                                                "sense_id": "e559bd0b-ca07-3323-84af-6dd344cbaabd",
                                                "text": "Trace a line of goose pimples up the thin young arm. Slide the needle in and push the bulb watching the junk hit him all over. Move right in with the shit and suck junk through all the hungry young cells."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5226087a-dd1c-41b0-acd2-4964e2533dfd",
                                                "sense_id": "e559bd0b-ca07-3323-84af-6dd344cbaabd",
                                                "text": "Ah love nothing (except junk), ah hate nothing (except forces that prevent me getting any) and ah fear nothing (except not scoring)."
                                            }
                                        ]
