                                                "sense_id": "beba69ac-5387-3b57-9a02-dc57fa279b9a",
                                                "text": "Then he lay quiet for a little, and then, pulling out a stick of tobacco, begged me to cut him a quid.\n“Cut me a junk o’ that,” says he, “for I haven’t no knife and hardly strength enough, so be as I had. […]”"
